WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:04.874
(car engine revving)

00:00:04.874 --> 00:00:07.291
(evil laugh)

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.820
- Come on Puddin', do it!

00:00:16.255 --> 00:00:18.422
- Oh, we have got company.

00:00:19.551 --> 00:00:21.384
- Batsy, Batsy, Batsy.

00:00:28.575 --> 00:00:30.882
Stupid Bats, you're ruining date night.

00:00:30.882 --> 00:00:33.623
(gun firing)

00:00:33.623 --> 00:00:38.498
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:38.498 --> 00:00:40.816
- Little spoiler alert there.

00:00:40.816 --> 00:00:42.618
Batman's in the movie.

00:00:42.618 --> 00:00:44.951
Yeah, Batman is in the film.

00:00:48.103 --> 00:00:50.610
Jared, you tried out
different laughs, didn't you?

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.160
For the Joker.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:53.428
Was it very difficult for you

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:54.937
to come up with the right laugh?

00:00:54.937 --> 00:00:57.383
Was it, I mean, how
annoying a process is that?

00:00:57.383 --> 00:00:59.195
- The Joker's laugh is an iconic thing,

00:00:59.195 --> 00:01:00.635
so there was a lot of pressure.

00:01:00.635 --> 00:01:02.389
I tried a lot of different laughs out

00:01:02.389 --> 00:01:04.754
on the streets of New York and Toronto.

00:01:04.754 --> 00:01:06.311
(laughing)

00:01:06.311 --> 00:01:08.026
- People just thought
something was wrong with you.

00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:09.509
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:09.509 --> 00:01:11.293
I had one that I knew wasn't right.

00:01:11.293 --> 00:01:12.718
It was kind of like.

00:01:12.718 --> 00:01:13.738
Hihihi.

00:01:13.738 --> 00:01:16.738
(audience laughing)

00:01:18.922 --> 00:01:19.755
- [Conan] That's not really good, yeah.

00:01:19.755 --> 00:01:20.588
- [Jared] I don't know,
maybe you liked that.

00:01:20.588 --> 00:01:22.044
I'm not sure.

00:01:22.044 --> 00:01:24.966
(laughing)

00:01:24.966 --> 00:01:27.466
- It's like a shy debutante.

00:01:28.336 --> 00:01:30.739
Karen, his laugh really bothered you.

00:01:30.739 --> 00:01:32.750
- Yeah, well, whenever I met Jared,

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.299
he never broke character.

00:01:34.299 --> 00:01:37.102
So, I would say, I'm Karen Fukuhara.

00:01:37.102 --> 00:01:38.485
Nice to meet you, I'm Katana

00:01:38.485 --> 00:01:40.015
and then he would over you with,

00:01:40.015 --> 00:01:42.682
"Ha ha ha, hi pretty".

00:01:44.344 --> 00:01:46.289
That was the worst impression ever.

00:01:46.289 --> 00:01:49.333
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, Jared.

00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:51.317
- I thought it was pretty good.

00:01:51.317 --> 00:01:54.317
(audience clapping)

00:01:55.961 --> 00:01:57.181
A very good wicked witch.

00:01:57.181 --> 00:01:58.014
That was excellent.

00:01:58.014 --> 00:01:59.931
- You have to teach me.

